{
  "_readme": "Every image listed here is optional. If the file is missing the game draws a procedural placeholder. Sheets: cols × rows grid; anims map a name to a row, a frame count and fps. chromaKey (e.g. \"#FF00FF\") makes that colour transparent for sheets generated on a flat background. worldHeight = metres the full frame height spans in the 3D arena. Gate frames: \"opening\" = transparent arch width as a fraction of the image width, \"top\" = arch top as a fraction of the height. \"fallback\" names another image to use when this file is missing. \"baseline\" = fraction of the cell height where the feet / trunk base sit (measured); the game anchors sprites there so nothing floats. version: added to every asset URL (?v=...) so browsers fetch fresh files; bump it whenever art is replaced under the same file name.",
